      "mergedPostDetails": "I just think it would be fun.\n\nAs a group admin, you can upload, say, 4 custom emoji (a low enough number that it will easily fit into an expressions menu, but also a square number so it can be tiled into a small texture)\n\nIf you're a member of the group, then their emoji show up in your expressions menu, and you can throw them in-game.",
