  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the latest beta, custom emotes are finally being implemented. This is amazing! I think it could be even better though.\n\nJust like how Discord servers can upload emotes for anyone in the server to use, Groups should have emote slots that the group owner/admins can upload to that any user in the group can use! For example, the Shelter group being able to upload a Shelter logo as an emote, that now anyone in the group has added to their custom emote menu.",
